  "text": "Upload and attach external paper lab reports to charts\n\nTo integrate outside paper reports or external PDF imaging into a patient's record, clinic staff must follow the secure ingestion workflow.\n\n### Steps to Upload\n1. Scan the paper document or save the external file as a standard PDF. Ensure the file size does not exceed 25 MB.\n2. Navigate to **Patients > Chart Search** and locate the correct individual.\n3. Open the chart and go to **Documents > Lab Reports**.\n4. Click **Upload New**, select your file, and choose the matching lab order from the dropdown list to link them.\n5. Click **Save and Verify** to complete the attachment.\n\n### Limits & Conditions\nOnly PDF, JPG, and PNG formats are accepted. Files over 25 MB will fail to process.\n\n### Troubleshooting\nIf the upload fails or the target lab order does not appear in the dropdown, verify that the lab order was previously created in **Labs > Active Orders**. For persistent upload errors, compress your PDF using the internal document toolkit or contact IT support with the error code."
 },
